@startuml
' The source<->formal FSM alignment check.
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  FontColor #10223A
}

rectangle "src/lib/lsp/fsm.cljs\nSTATES · TRANSITIONS · state->connected?" as cljs #5FA55A
rectangle "formal/tla/LspConnection.tla\nStates · AllowedTransition · ConnectedState" as tla #E6A9B0
rectangle "formal/rocq/Async/Fsm.v\nall_states · all_transitions · connected_state" as coq #E6A9B0

rectangle "verify-formal-alignment.js\nextract → normalize (CamelCase↔kebab) → assertSame" as gate #F5C77E

cljs --> gate
tla --> gate
coq --> gate

rectangle "Must be IDENTICAL:\n7 states · 17 transitions · 3 connected-states" as ok #A9DCB5
gate --> ok : else build FAILS

note bottom of gate
  Plus regex assertions over source:
  no direct :state writes; shutdown clears
  pending; responses matched by id; didClose
  suppressed while a URI is shared.
end note
@enduml
